#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:140
msgid "Selecting Graphical Elements"
msgstr "Markera grafiska element"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:142
msgid ""
"Selecting the graphical element requires placing the mouse pointer over the "
"element and then clicking the primary mouse button. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> indicates the element is selected by "
"drawing eight 'grab handles' around the element; these are small circles at "
"the four corners and in the middle of the four edges of a rectangle "
"surrounding the graphical element."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill markera ett grafiskt element för du muspekaren över det och "
"klickar med den primära musknappen. <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"visar att elementet är markerat genom att rita åtta handtag runt det. "
"Handtagen är små cirklar vid rektangelns fyra hörn och mitt på dess fyra "
"sidor."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:153
msgid "A graphical element which has been selected."
msgstr "Ett markerat grafiskt element."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:169
msgid ""
"The graphical column plot has been selected as evidenced by the eight small "
"circular 'grab handles' at the corners and in the middle of each edge."
msgstr ""
"Kolumndiagrammet är markerat. Det syns på de åtta små cirkelformade "
"handtagen vid hörnen och mitt på varje sida."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:157
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/graphical-elements-selected.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of several "
"graphical elements of which one has been selected, and is therefore showing "
"its grab handles. </phrase> </textobject> <_:caption-1/>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/graphical-elements-selected.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av flera "
"grafiska element, varav ett är markerat och därför visar sina "
"handtag.</phrase> </textobject> <_:caption-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:180
msgid ""
"The mouse pointer will also change shape when placed over a selected element"
" or over the element's 'grab handles'. When the pointer is placed over a "
"selected element, the mouse pointer will change to the 'move' shape, "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_four_way_arrow.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject>"
" <phrase>An image of the move mouse pointer.</phrase> </textobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject>; when the pointer is placed over the element's 'grab "
"handles' it will change to one of the resizing mouse pointer shapes, which "
"are presented in <xref linkend=\"sect-gui-mouse\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Muspekaren ändrar också utseende när den placeras över ett markerat element "
"eller dess handtag. Över själva elementet blir pekaren en flyttmarkör, "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_four_way_arrow.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject>"
" <phrase>En bild av muspekaren för flyttning.</phrase> </textobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject>. Över handtagen blir den en av storleksändringspekaren "
"som visas i <xref linkend=\"sect-gui-mouse\"/>."
